# Only Code/, submission/weights/ and submission/infer.py are copied into the
# image, but pruning the context keeps `docker build` from streaming ~100s of GB
# of data, logs and checkpoints to the daemon on every build.
*
!Code
!time_totalsegmentator.py
!submission/requirements.txt
!submission/infer.py
!submission/weights
!submission/totalseg_runner.py
Code/__pycache__
Code/._*
